{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/760466-what-would-a-______-spirit-look-like","id":760466,"title":"What would a ______ spirit look like?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-11-07T20:52:29-08:00","id":760466,"title":"What would a ______ spirit look like?","content":"For those who want an opinion on how the variable, animistic spirits of the Hisil would look like I make this thread. To start off:<br /> <br /> In your estimation what would a spirit of love look like to you?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-07T23:38:56-08:00","id":760533,"title":"","content":"Does it have to be something you see? How about making it perceptible to a different sense, a smell or sound, or even in this case the feeling itself just disembodied. You feel it but not for anything, just a feeling without cause. Think of what this would say about panic attacks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6084-2pttakrill","name":"2ptTakrill","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"942"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-08T08:31:38-08:00","id":760677,"title":"","content":"I pictured a cloud of rose-scented pink mist.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-08T12:17:41-08:00","id":760831,"title":"","content":"What kind of love? That's the first question you have to ask yourself with each spirit you make. A spirit of fraternal love isn't going to look or do the same as one tainted by corporate enterprise behind such things as Valentine's Day. Neither would a platonic love compare to a esprit de corps spirit, no actual redundancy. (I'm looking at you, Band of Brothers.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":576,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","user":"Ephsy","date":". 11-08-2015, 04:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-08T12:38:50-08:00","id":760859,"title":"","content":"I started <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/595029-mix-and-match-spirit-influences-and-designs\"><b>a thread like this</b></a> some time ago, but it was specifically about combinations of spirit types. I'm guessing that more savvy love spirits would have the Mortal Mask Numen to not freak people out. Personally, one of the clearest mental images I have of a love spirit using that Numen is a smiling, welcoming, serene granny, all knitted sweaters and home made cookies.<br /> <br /> Also, just because it is a love spirit does not mean it will be friendly. It could be the possessive love of mentally unstable stalkers, for example.<br /> <br /> Another interesting question: what does a madness spirit look like? There are many types of madness, of course, which could lead to many appearances.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":4443,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","user":"GibberingEloquence","date":". 11-08-2015, 03:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-08T12:43:08-08:00","id":760863,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ephsy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/760466-what-would-a-______-spirit-look-like?p=760831#post760831\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What kind of love? That's the first question you have to ask yourself with each spirit you make. A spirit of fraternal love isn't going to look or do the same as one tainted by corporate enterprise behind such things as Valentine's Day. Neither would a platonic love compare to a spirit d'corps spirit, no actual redundancy. (I'm looking at you, Band of Brothers.)</div> </div> </div> </div>It's &quot;esprit de corps&quot; not &quot;spirit d'corps&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-08T17:45:29-08:00","id":761076,"title":"","content":"Something resembling Rose Quartz from Steven Universe keeps coming to mind. A strong protective love.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-13T17:07:37-08:00","id":785638,"title":"","content":"I have been trying to think of what a movie spirit might look like, but I guess that depends on what movie genre it prefers. I guess it might look like a christmas spirit, but instead of being a serpent-shaped collection of red and green lights with ribbons of gift wrappings, it is a serpent-shaped collection of film rolls with projector-shaped head.<br /> <br /> As for what Influence over Movies would do, I think it would warp local reality so that events follow a more cinematic logic. At 4 and 5 dots, the spirit would be able to actually create solid props and bit characters that follow its idea of a movie.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-13T17:22:53-08:00","id":785644,"title":"","content":"<img src=\"https://lefthandhorror.files.wordpress.com/2012/04/shocker3.jpg?w=620\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> More of a television movie spirit, and a CRT one. I think a rank 4 or 5 movie spirit would be rare or hard to find, but your ideas for their Influence sounds right, providing it's a genre. Otherwise it could entertain and distract, draw out emotions through scenes specially chosen for its targets. Maybe they'd be more common in Hollywood, or really old movie theaters that still manage to draw large audiences.<br /> <br /> In Clive Barker's Son of Celluloid, it sort of messes with people by manifesting characters from movies. The Scream movies, or the events within, could be the influence of a powerful horror movie spirit, given the deconstruction and metaconcepts involved.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 12-13-2015, 08:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-23T03:39:51-08:00","id":791467,"title":"","content":"I suppose a table top gaming spirit would look like every single one of us (even everyone commenting on this thread, me included ) blended into a single strange and awkward looking androgynous &quot;human&quot;, with a palpable aura of nazis esque adherence to rule interpretation and munchkin ism. In short, a creature of pure, unmitigated power and terror packaged in a goofy looking container.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1686,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","user":"Korogra","date":". 12-23-2015, 06:43 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}